### 📌 Overview

The **Mule Account Detection Engine** is an enterprise compliance tool designed to catch money mule accounts that bypass standard KYC checks[cite: 5]. By monitoring post-activation transaction velocity spikes, structural fan-in/fan-out flows, and device overlaps, the system detects suspicious activity and auto-generates regulatory Suspicious Activity Reports (SARs)[cite: 5].
